// A custom event schema in place of the default: the event kinds
// are `attempt` (the decision kind) and `outcome` (history), NOT the
// conventional request/response, and the injected principal field is
// named `actor` rather than `callerPrincipal`. It shows that (a) a
// bundle's own event.dwschema replaces the default, (b) author-defined
// kinds work end to end, and (c) a renamed injected field is usable.
decision event <A>::attempt {
    ...inputs(A),
    actor: principalType(A),
}

event <A>::outcome {
    ...inputs(A),
    ...outputs(A),
    actor: principalType(A),
}
